# Versioned Provides required so tasksel-data's strict
# `Depends: tasksel (= 3.73)` resolves to us.  dpkg treats
# unversioned Provides as version `<none>` which fails strict-version
# checks.  See memory/feedback_fork_provides_must_be_versioned.md.
Provides: tasksel (= 3.73)
Description: tool for selecting tasks for installation (Athena fork)
 Athena's fork of upstream Debian tasksel.  Single functional change
 from upstream 3.73: the list_task_descs() Perl sub ignores the
 DEBIAN_TASKS_ONLY environment variable and always globs all .desc
 files in /usr/share/tasksel/descs/.
 .
 The upstream behaviour (filter to debian-tasks.desc only when
 DEBIAN_TASKS_ONLY=1 is set) is incompatible with derivative
 distributions that ship additional task .desc files alongside
 Debian's — pkgsel sets DEBIAN_TASKS_ONLY=1 unconditionally during
 the installer's software-selection step, which would hide our
 athena.desc.  Our fork eliminates that filter at source rather
 than patching pkgsel to drop the env var.
 .
 Provides + Conflicts + Replaces tasksel so apt resolves any
 dependency on `tasksel` to this fork, and the upstream tasksel
 package cannot coexist.
